<<
/Title (The original design needs modification because the robot cannot identify its exact location after sensor failure. Belief-state search allows the robot to consider multiple possible locations. Adding a local sensor reduces uncertainty and helps it select a suitable route.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 857 0 R
/Next 1084 0 R
>>
endobj
1084 0 obj
<<
/Title (Therefore, I recommend Belief-State Search with Local Sensing as the modified design because it improves location awareness, reduces uncertainty and supports reliable medicine delivery.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 857 0 R
/Prev 1083 0 R
>>
endobj
